# Used only by create_session_storage.py / create_memory_bank.py, the
# one-time setup for shared state that every ADK agent in this repo can
# point at. Run `gcloud auth application-default login` then
# `gcloud auth application-default set-quota-project <project>` once.
GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=
GOOGLE_CLOUD_LOCATION=us-central1
